    "description": "Covers Module 9 (API_001-API_010) from the ConvertPolo Manual QA & Shopify Testing assignment.\n\nNote on scope: convertpolo.com turned out to be a WordPress agency site with no cart/checkout/PDP at all, so Module 9 doesn't apply to it. Only ran API tests against itokri.com and sg.anothersole.com, since those are the two actual Shopify stores in the assignment.\n\nBefore running:\n1. Import the environment file too and select it (top-right dropdown).\n2. Turn on Postman's cookie jar, otherwise cart/add.js and cart.js won't share the same session.\n3. Replace the *_variant_id placeholders with a real variant id — run API_001 first, copy an id from the 'variants' array (not the top-level product id, that's a different field and gives a 422).\n4. If running the whole folder through the Collection Runner, add a ~500-1000ms delay between requests — ran into 429s a couple of times without it.",
